{"title":"Linearkombinationen im Raum berechnen","puid":"c-mat-11-algebra/augy45","path":"/../c-mat-11-algebra/topic-02-vektoren/block-06-mit-vektoren-rechnen/level-03","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","voice":"f5_2025","instruction":{"voice":"m3_2025","speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"calculator":true,"textAlign":"left","hint":{"label":"Hilfe","text":{"text":"<m-yellow><t-yellow>&nbsp;Grundlagen&nbsp;</m-yellow></t-yellow>&nbsp; Eine <b>Linearkombination</b> ist ein Vektor, der durch die <b>Addition</b> und die <b>Skalarmultiplikation</b> von gegebenen Vektoren und Zahlen entsteht:<mat center=true>rarrow(v) = r * rarrow(a) + s * rarrow(b) + ... + t * rarrow(c)</mat><br><b>Beispiel:</b><br><mat align = 'lll'>rarrow(v) ||=|| 2*vector(4, 3, 5) - 3*vector(-1,2,1)+vector(0,6,-2) <br>||=|| vector(2*4,2*3,2*5)-vector(3*(-1),3*2,3*1)+vector(0,6,-2)=vector(11,6,5)</mat><br><br>Dabei müssen die folgenden Rechenregeln beachtet werden:<br><br><b>Addition von Vektoren</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;Kommutativgesetz: <mat>rarrow(u)+rarrow(v)=rarrow(v)+rarrow(u)</mat><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;Assoziativgesetz: <mat>(rarrow(u)+rarrow(v))+rarrow(w)=rarrow(u)+(rarrow(v)+rarrow(w))</mat><br><br><b>Multiplikation mit Skalaren</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;Assoziativgesetz: <mat>(r*t)*rarrow(u)=r*(t*rarrow(u))</mat><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;Distributivgesetz: <mat>r*(rarrow(u)+rarrow(v))=r*rarrow(u)+r*rarrow(v)</mat>"}},"trainers":[{"trainer":"mathFormula","instruction":{"text":"Berechne die Linearkombination.<br> <i>Du kannst auch schrittweise rechnen.</i>","speaker":true},"mode":"term","shuffleAtoms":true,"totalAtoms":"3","atoms":[{"a":"<mat>v = 2*vector(3.5,-2,5)+3*vector(1,4,-3)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(10,8,1)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| 2*vector(3.5,-2,5)+3*vector(1,4,-3) <br>\n                      ||=|| vector(2*3.5 + 3*1, 2*(-2) + 3*4, 2*5 + 3*(-3)) <br>\n                      ||=|| vector(7+3, -4+12, 10-9) <br>\n||=|| vector(10,8,1)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>v = -1*vector(-5,2.5,1)+2*vector(4,-3,6)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(13,-8.5,11)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| -1*vector(-5,2.5,1)+2*vector(4,-3,6) <br>\n                        ||=|| vector(-1*(-5)+2*4, -1*2.5 + 2*(-3), -1*1 + 2*6) <br>\n                        ||=|| vector(5+8, -2.5-6, -1+12) <br>\n||=|| vector(13,-8.5,11)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>v = 4*vector(2,-4,0.5)-3*vector(-1,3,-2)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(11,-25,8)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| 4*vector(2,-4,0.5)-3*vector(-1,3,-2) <br>\n                      ||=|| vector(4*2 - 3*(-1), 4*(-4) - 3*3, 4*0.5 - 3*(-2)) <br>\n                      ||=|| vector(8+3, -16-9, 2+6) <br>\n||=|| vector(11,-25,8)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>v = 0.5*vector(-3,6,2)+2.5*vector(4,-2,1)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(8.5,-2,3.5)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| 0.5*vector(-3,6,2)+2.5*vector(4,-2,1) <br>\n                            ||=|| vector(0.5*(-3) + 2.5*4, 0.5*6 + 2.5*(-2), 0.5*2 + 2.5*1) <br>\n                            ||=|| vector(-1.5+10, 3-5, 1+2.5) <br>\n||=|| vector(8.5,-2,3.5)</mat>"}]},{"trainer":"mathFormula","instruction":{"text":"Berechne die Linearkombination.<br> <i>Du kannst auch schrittweise rechnen.</i>","speaker":true},"mode":"term","shuffleAtoms":true,"totalAtoms":"3","atoms":[{"a":"<mat>v = 3*vector(2,3,-4)-vector(-1,0.5,5)-vector(2,-1,3)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(5,9.5,-20)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| 3*vector(2,3,-4)-vector(-1,0.5,5)-vector(2,-1,3) <br>\n                         ||=|| vector(3*2 - (-1) - 2, 3*3 - 0.5 - (-1), 3*(-4) - 5 - 3) <br>\n                         ||=|| vector(6+1-2, 9-0.5+1, -12-5-3) <br>\n||=|| vector(5,9.5,-20)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>v = -2*vector(1.5,-2,3)-1.5*vector(-4,1,2)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(3,2.5,-9)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| -2*vector(1.5,-2,3)-1.5*vector(-4,1,2) <br>\n                        ||=|| vector(-2*1.5 - 1.5*(-4), -2*(-2) - 1.5*1, -2*3 - 1.5*2) <br>\n                        ||=|| vector(-3 + 6, 4 - 1.5, -6 - 3) <br>\n                        ||=|| vector(3,2.5,-9)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>v = -2*(vector(0,-2,4.5)-2*vector(5,1.5,-1))-vector(1,-3,2)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(19,13,-15)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| -2*(vector(0,-2,4.5)-2*vector(5,1.5,-1))-vector(1,-3,2) <br>\n                                  ||=|| vector(-2*0 + 4*5 - 1, -2*(-2) + 4*1.5 - (-3), -2*4.5 + 4*(-1) - 2) <br>\n                                  ||=|| vector(0+20-1, 4+6.0+3, -9.0-4-2) <br>\n||=|| vector(19,13,-15)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>v = 2*vector(4,-1,2)-vector(-3,2,1)-2*vector(1.5,0.5,-4)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(8,-5,11)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| 2*vector(4,-1,2)-vector(-3,2,1)-2*vector(1.5,0.5,-4) <br>\n                                  ||=|| vector(2*4 - (-3) - 2*1.5, 2*(-1) - 2 - 2*0.5, 2*2 - 1 - 2*(-4)) <br>\n                                  ||=|| vector(8 + 3 - 3, -2 - 2 - 1, 4 - 1 + 8) <br>\n||=|| vector(8,-5,11)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>v = vector(3,-1,0)-2*vector(-2,4,1)+4*vector(0.5,-2,3)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(9,-17,10)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| vector(3,-1,0)-2*vector(-2,4,1)+4*vector(0.5,-2,3) <br>\n                          ||=|| vector(3 - 2*(-2) + 4*0.5, -1 - 2*4 + 4*(-2), 0 - 2*1 + 4*3) <br>\n                          ||=|| vector(3+4+2, -1-8-8, -2+12) <br>\n||=|| vector(9,-17,10)</mat>"},{"a":"<mat>v = 1.5*vector(2,4,-6)+2*vector(-1,0,2)-vector(3,-2,1)</mat>","b":{"solution":"<mat>vector(-2,8,-6)</mat>","prefix":"<mat>v</mat>"},"sampleSolution":"<mat center='true'><b>`Möglicher Lösungsweg`</b></mat><hr><br><br>\n<mat align='rcl'>\nv ||=|| 1.5*vector(2,4,-6)+2*vector(-1,0,2)-vector(3,-2,1) <br>\n                              ||=|| vector(1.5*2 + 2*(-1) - 3, 1.5*4 + 2*0 - (-2), 1.5*(-6) + 2*2 - 1) <br>\n                              ||=|| vector(3-2-3, 6+0+2, -9+4-1) <br>\n||=|| vector(-2,8,-6)</mat>"}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Vektoren","path":"/../c-mat-11-algebra/topic-02-vektoren/topic","puid":"c-mat-11-algebra/j8z5pp"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Mit Vektoren rechnen","path":"/../c-mat-11-algebra/topic-02-vektoren/block-06-mit-vektoren-rechnen/block","puid":"c-mat-11-algebra/0d4mrg"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/de/m3_2025/Berechne die Linearkombination.<br> <i>Du kannst auch schrittweise rechnen.</i>","etag":"3d7a-20734"}],"svgs":[],"lsgs":[],"images":[]},"etag":"57da-7334"}